  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29666,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zuì hòu dào chī fàn\n最后到吃饭\nand finally eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32833,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jīn tiān yī rán shì yī qī\n今天依然是一期\nToday's episode is still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34333,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kě lǐ jiě xìng shū rù de shì pín\n可理解性输入的视频\na comprehensible input video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37033,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suǒ yǐ nǐ yào guān chá wǒ de dòng zuò\n所以你要观察我的动作\nSo, observe my actions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39366,
    "dDurationMs": 3934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tōng guò dòng zuò qù lǐ jiě zhè ge zhōng wén de dān cí\n通过动作去理解这个中文的单词\nand understand the Chinese words through them."
