  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82800,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a wǒ xiàn zài yào xiān zhǔ miàn zhǔ miàn\n啊我现在要先煮面煮面\nNow I'm going to cook the pasta first."
