    "tStartMs": 868766,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jiē xià lái wǒ yào bǎ gāng cái zhǔ de miàn tiáo ne\n接下来我要把刚才煮的面条呢\nNext, I'll take the noodles I cooked earlier"
