  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883000,
    "dDurationMs": 4766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ràng zhè ge jiàng zhī ne chōng fèn de bāo guǒ zài miàn tiáo shàng\n让这个酱汁呢充分的包裹在面条上\nso the sauce thoroughly coats the noodles."
