    "tStartMs": 1005766,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ér qiě wǒ jué de zì jǐ zuò fàn yě huì gèng jiàn kāng\n而且我觉得自己做饭也会更健康\nI also think cooking for yourself is healthier"
